    "turn_text": "Hello, hello, and welcome back to another episode of Minority Report's podcast and digital series. I am your host, Mona Shank, and today's guest is very, very special. She is very special. She's so inspiring. She has made me listen to Beyonce all morning who run the world girls because of her incredibly inspirational book. I am very proud and very excited to have former congresswoman Katie Hill with us today. She will be talking about her incredible new book which I so highly recommend that you guys go and check it out especially if you're a woman and you're a man and you're an ally. I highly, highly recommend this book. I learned so much. It is called She Will Rise Becoming a Warrior in the Battle for True Equality. All right. Let's welcome Congresswoman Katie Hill. Welcome. How are you? Hello. Thanks so much. Thank you so much for being here. This is a little surreal because I messaged you and you were so kind enough to respond. So this is very exciting.",
